<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: 0, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 36, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>三个可验证的子问题</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#B9CCEA' }}>01 · Questions</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 598, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 28, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', padding: '18px 24px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', height: 84 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>研究问题</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
        把第 4 页的三重断裂拆成三个可被实验证伪的子问题，每个子问题对应一项可量化考核指标。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 24 }}>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 138, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 78 }}>Q1</Text>
        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, paddingRight: 36 }}>
          完全不用预训练语义分割，仅凭光流运动残差与单目深度几何一致性，能否把动态像素召回率稳定做到 92% 以上？
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 6 }}>考核指标</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>F1 ≥ 0.90，Accuracy ≥ 0.95（TUM fr3/walking 四序列）</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 138, borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 78 }}>Q2</Text>
        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, paddingRight: 36 }}>
          把尺度因子当作显式优化变量、与 SE(3) 位姿同层求解后，单目轨迹能否在动态外点存在时收敛到厘米量级？
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 6 }}>考核指标</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>ATE RMSE ≤ 0.020 m；相对 ORB-SLAM3 改善 ≥ 1 个数量级</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 138 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 78 }}>Q3</Text>
        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55, paddingRight: 36 }}>
          语义特征挂在同一个高斯基元上时，能否在不显著膨胀地图体积的前提下支撑开放词汇查询，并直接交给导航层使用？
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', marginBottom: 6 }}>考核指标</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>查询召回 ≥ 0.80；单次查询 ≤ 100 ms；地图体积增长 ≤ 1.3 倍</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 50, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态环境下视觉语言模型辅助三维高斯语义建图与机器人目标导航</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>7 / 26</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
